## 6. Profile (PROFILE tab)

### PWA Pattern (from [Profile.tsx](file:///C:/Users/HP/Documents/GitHub/checkly-smart/src/pages/Profile.tsx))

| Element | Detail |
|---------|--------|
| **Header** | "Profile" + "Your account settings" |
