## 9. Workflow Recommendation

All gaps are **Track B** (UI work, no complex business logic). No ATDD needed.

### Suggested Slicing for Builder

```
Slice A: Bottom Nav + Profile Page + Routes        → /implement
Slice B: CriteriaCard Redesign (the big one)       → /implement
Slice C: Action Plans List + Detail Pages           → /implement
Slice D: Dashboard Hero + Audits List Redesign      → /implement
Slice E: Notification Bell + Polish Animations      → /implement
Slice F: Admin Dashboard + Audit Approval           → /implement
Slice G: Analytics + Template Builder               → /implement
Slice H: Store Dashboard + Activity History         → /implement
```

> [!TIP]
> **Slice B (CriteriaCard)** is the highest-value item. It's the screen auditors spend 95% of their time on. Getting the FAULTS/REPEAT steppers, CCP/RISK toggles, and NOTE/PHOTO interaction pattern exactly right is critical for adoption.
